  "notes": "{凍|こお}る means to freeze, to become frozen.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Causative: {凍|こお}らせる (to freeze something)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{凍|こお}っている indicates a frozen state: {水|みず}が{凍|こお}っている (the water is frozen).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {水|みず}が{凍|こお}る: water freezes\n- {湖|みずうみ}が{凍|こお}る: the lake freezes\n- {凍|こお}りつく: to freeze solid\n- カチカチに{凍|こお}る: to freeze rock-hard\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {氷|こおり}: ice\n- {冷凍|れいとう}: freezing (for food preservation)\n- {冷凍庫|れいとうこ}: freezer\n- {凍結|とうけつ}: freezing (roads), also 'freeze' (of accounts)\n\nFIGURATIVE:\n- {血|ち}が{凍|こお}る: blood runs cold (from fear)\n- {場|ば}が{凍|こお}る: the atmosphere freezes (awkward silence)",
